Link previews
    The 128 JPEGs under public/og/ are written by scripts/make-og-previews.mjs
    through the application's own pixel pipeline (renderRgba), and the set is
    held to the place catalogue by tests. They are this repository's own
    images: the MIT licence covers the code only and does not cover them.

Inter
    The app's font, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://rsms.me/inter/). It is
    fetched at build time by next/font (src/app/layout.tsx) and by
    scripts/make-og-card.mjs; no font file is committed here, so it is a
    build-time dependency, not a shipped asset.

create-next-app boilerplate
