    file (public/next.svg, public/vercel.svg, src/app/favicon.ico,
    src/app/page.module.css) exists at any commit. next.config.js,
    postcss.config.js, tailwind.config.js, src/app/layout.tsx and
    src/app/globals.css have the template's default shape (the Inter import,
    the Tailwind directives) and are edited here; none carries a third-party
    copyright or licence line. Next.js itself is MIT, and the packages that
    carry it are fetched at install time (Dependencies, below).

